INTRODUCTION
===========

SDLHana is an SDL-based Hanafuda game. Hanafuda is a Japanese-oriented
card game which is mostly played in Japan and Korea, also known as
"Hwa-T'u" in Korean.

For more details about Hanafuda, check out the Wikipedia:
http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hanafuda

Enjoy playing.


INSTALLATION
===========
SDLHana uses CMake (3.25+) and FetchContent. Dependencies (SDL3, SDL3_mixer, SDL3_ttf) are automatically fetched during the build.

To build on Windows, macOS, or Linux:

cmake -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release
cmake --build build --config Release

The compiled executable `sdlhana` (or `sdlhana.exe`) will be generated inside `build/Release` or `build/Debug`.
